{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is seen, approach it, grab it, move and check properties. Otherwise, scan and move randomly. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectGrabbed    /> <Condition ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />\"",
